WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.760
Where am I? What...

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.900
What happened to me?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.230
<i>Kill.</i>

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.240
<i>Kill.</i>

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Kill.</i>

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:02.280
So you're awake, Shin.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.160
F-Father?

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:10.710
Welcome to the Shoshidai, Shin Matoba.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.130
The Shoshidai?

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:18.260
Do you remember the Busoma?
It's the monster you defeated.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.680
Yes.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:30.440
Weapons which have absorbed a lot of blood
sometimes gain a life of their own.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:35.570
And when they do, they possess people
and turn them into Busoma.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:38.820
Weapons possess people?

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:47.540
The Shoshidai has fought the Busoma
since ancient times.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:51.920
Your father,
owner of the Matoba Group,

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.840
has donated a lot of money
to the Shoshidai.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.880
Why would you invest
in an organization like that?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:03.550
You should understand my feelings
for the reason.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.230
What do you want to do at the beach, Rie?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.980
I'm gonna make a sand castle
with you, Mommy!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.990
Shin, do you want to go fishing with me?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.570
-Yeah!
-No!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.490
You're going to make a castle with me!

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.000
What is that?

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.390
N-No... Stay away!

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.220
No!

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:57.900
Shin, just like you, that incident left
a dark shadow inside my heart.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.240
I've fought this whole time,
in my own way.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:08.030
Dad. Then tell me since you would know.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.750
What will happen to me?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.460
I can feel it. The Shiryu is within me.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:21.670
Will I become a monster like that thing?
Since the Shiryu possessed me?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.760
Save me, Father!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:25.050
Save me!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.430
I can clearly see the shadow
of the Core Alma.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.520
And the Maldicion values
are a little high, too.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.070
Use the Prismaphon, please.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:45.660
That's still at the experimental stage!
Clinical trials aren't done.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.490
You'd use it on your son?

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.200
Eventually, he'll become a Busoma.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.700
He's as good as dead now.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:57.540
If there's a chance he could revert
to his original body, I'll take that risk.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.130
I want to save my son right away.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:07.680
<i>I can't promise it will work.
<i>You're okay with that, right?</i></i>

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.640
Yes, I am.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:14.770
I'm scared of myself.
I could go crazy at any moment.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:19.440
<i>I'm grateful my father asked you
<i>to use the medicine.</i></i>

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.820
I see. Alright.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:23.780
Begin.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:10.950
Are your wounds okay?

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.540
For what reason did you save him?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.880
He's a Busoma.
He should be killed immediately.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.210
Indeed.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:31.850
But Kazumo, it's also true
that my voice reached him.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:38.270
He was a Busoma,
but he heard my voice and came here.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:44.940
He was searching of help.
The duty of the Gabi is to save souls.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:48.450
So we must fulfill our duty,

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:51.110
even if it's a Busoma's soul.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.410
I hope nothing bad happens.

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.450
You can eat it all.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:05.170
So good!

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.460
Have Gai look after him.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.090
He seems to have taken a liking to Gai.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:13.260
He saved Gai from you, right?

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.310
Kazumo.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:24.230
Starting at sunset,
I'll fast and meditate in the holy place.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.360
The holy place?

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:31.860
There are so many Busoma out there,
now more than ever.

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.490
Perhaps it is time for the world
to undergo a great change.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:43.080
And there must be some meaning,
within the 300 year history of the Gabi,

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.670
that I am here now.

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:51.470
It seems you have your own reason
for being concerned about me.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:55.390
But I'll say this again.
There's no need to worry.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:03.100
I will live my life
in accordance with my destiny.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.150
Lady Himiko...

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:58.990
Hey! What are you doing?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.670
Bastard!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.290
How dare you climb our sacred tree?
None may even touch it!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:13.300
We cannot forgive your actions
for defiling the tree!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.930
No... Don't bully me.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:21.930
What?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:25.940
Bully you?

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.150
Are you mocking us, punk?

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:33.440
No!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.700
This is your punishment
for defiling the tree!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:40.910
Stop it.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.790
You... Don't get in our way!

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.580
Stop. That's enough.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.630
-But...
-Let's go.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:57.470
Th-Thank you for saving me, G-Gai.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:09:59.680
Gai.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:00.930
Friend.

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:07.140
It's time for lunch. Let's go.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:23.790
I heard you already got in a fight
because of him.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:29.080
Well, keep watching over him.
Consider it part of your training.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.170
What's wrong?

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:33.750
I saw it.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:36.420
He stopped himself
from becoming a Busoma.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:43.350
He held down his killing intent
with his willpower.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:48.810
Even without the Shiryu,
the murderous intent within me remains.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:58.490
Can I restrain the killing intent
within me as well?

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.450
I don't want to go back to who I was.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:08.410
There's no need to rush.
Your training has only just begin.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:14.380
Someone once asked me to kill him
if he became a Busoma.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:18.420
When I look like I'm about
to give in to my desire to kill...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.680
Kill me with your own hands.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.930
Don't be silly.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.640
Many weapons sleep within you.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:32.690
If I'm going to meet my end,
I'd like to sleep within you as well.

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:34.810
Gai...

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:40.990
The desire to change is the hope
that was born within you.

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:45.700
As long as you have that hope,
the flowers will bloom.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.180
<i>It's not good enough to protect you,</i>

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.430
<i>but I want you to have it.</i>

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.390
Gai...

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:12.850
It was my mistake to give him the Shiryu.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.270
It's not your fault.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:20.740
Weapons can kill people,
or keep them alive.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.240
I wanted to give Gai life.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.000
<i>Wonderful.</i>

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.340
<i>The Maldicion values
<i>in his blood are fine, too.</i></i>

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.760
<i>And the Core Alma's shadow
<i>is completely gone!</i></i>

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.300
Then I've...

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:48.180
<i>Yes, we can assume you've reverted back
<i>to your previous body.</i></i>

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.640
<i>At least, that's what the data shows.</i>

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.480
<i>Okay, we've got a few more tests to do.</i>

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.400
Okay!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.400
Amazing.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.610
The Core Alma is really gone.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:09.910
<i>If it works this well on Crysali,
<i>it should work on Busoma, too!</i></i>

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.790
<i>Now I can save my father!</i>

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.770
<i>You woke up, huh?
<i>Your examination is done.</i></i>

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.910
The Shiryu is here?

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.640
Is this what's calling to me?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.610
What? Got it!

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:29.160
Administrator!
Shin Matoba took a Sage Alma and ran!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:30.950
What?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.540
What were you doing?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.870
W-Well...

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.670
The security system wasn't working at all.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.380
That's theoretically impossible, but...

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:47.130
He took Gai Ogata's prosthetic arm.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.090
The Shiryu?

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:52.890
<i>Shin Matoba's Core Alma
<i>was the true Shiryu.</i></i>

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.890
<i>And Ogata's was the inferior version,
<i>so I'm told.</i></i>

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.560
<i>The true and inferior Shiryus...</i>

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:02.560
<i>Is there some connection?</i>

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:04.440
Administrator...

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.570
Get a search team out there, now!
Capture Shin Matoba!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.860
There's no need.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:12.700
Mr. Matoba?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.040
These are the orders of Apostolo 3.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.290
You won't be held responsible.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.210
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.000
Where am I? Wh-Why am I...

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:09.800
I heard a voice.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.260
And the next thing I knew,
I was in front of you.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:14.840
A voice?

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.810
You can hear it, too, right?
The voice of the Shiryu.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.850
This is the Shiryu, right?

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:25.150
How do you know about the Shiryu?

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.730
I'm the same.
The other Shiryu was within me.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.360
<i>The Shiryu and I are connected
<i>by bonds of fate.</i></i>

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:39.830
<i>Is there no way to break them,
<i>no matter what happens?</i></i>

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.000
Are you sure?

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.050
I don't need it anymore.

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:54.930
Wait!

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:07.900
You saved me before, right?
Do you remember? At the park!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:16.200
Thank you for that.
I always wanted to thank you.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.820
I'm glad we met again.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:21.040
But what are you doing
in a place like this?

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.410
You're Ogata's little brother, right?

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.800
No. We just grew up together.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.420
What? Really?

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.140
Oh no!

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.280
Get off the mountain!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.200
But...

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.450
Hurry!

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:15.090
Gai!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.070
Kuromaru!

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.170
<i>No...</i>

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.170
<i>No...</i>

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.590
<i>No...</i>

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.390
<i>No... Don't kill them!</i>

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:11.440
Gai, no!

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:14.900
Stop!

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:40.800
Gai!

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.310
I never should've saved you.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.280
I should've killed you that time!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:43.650
But it's too late for regrets, Gai!
